\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Classical and quantum optics utility of PVB completeness. (a) Sturm--Liouville RCF coupling $\eta _l$ ($r_1=6.0\,\mu \mathrm  {m}, r_2=9.0\,\mu \mathrm  {m}, \Delta n=0.033, \lambda =1550\,\mathrm  {nm}$) for PVBs ($w=1.72\,\mu \mathrm  {m}$, mean $0.985$) vs.\ $\mathrm  {LG}_{0,l}$ ($w_0=4.50, 3.22\,\mu \mathrm  {m}$), achieving $+6.90\,\mathrm  {dB}$ gain at $l=4$; inset shows $l=4$ OOK BER with the $0.41\,\mathrm  {dB}$ AWGN ZF penalty at $\Delta R = 2.0w$. (b) Intensity MSE (solid, $\pm 1\,\mathrm  {SEM}$) and field MSE (dashed/dash-dotted) over 40 Kolmogorov phase screens ($D=3.0\,\mathrm  {mm}, z=0.5\,\mathrm  {m}$) for raw, $P_{\mathrm  {RKHS}}$, and Tikhonov ($\alpha _{\mathrm  {reg}}=0.0183$) filtering. (c) Passive $M=5$ Gouy IC-POVM radial qudit tomography ($d=4, l=1, w/w_0=0.25$, rank $16/16$ vs.\ $7/16$ at $M=1$): $R\rho R$ MLE MSE (circles, 30 trials) tracks CRB $41.80/N_{\mathrm  {phot}}$ alongside 5-MUB tomography ($18.75/N_{\mathrm  {phot}}$). (d) SPDC Bell--CHSH $S$ vs.\ circular-iris radius $R_{\mathrm  {iris}}/R_0$ for $(l=1,4)$ ($w=0.1 R_0$, LG $w_0=\sqrt  {2}R_0$); inset shows $t_{1..4}(R_0)$ ($0.4999\text  {--}0.4984$ PVB vs.\ $0.2642\text  {--}0.0037$ LG).}}{11}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:optics_utility}{{3}{11}{Classical and quantum optics utility of PVB completeness. (a) Sturm--Liouville RCF coupling $\eta _l$ ($r_1=6.0\,\mu \mathrm {m}, r_2=9.0\,\mu \mathrm {m}, \Delta n=0.033, \lambda =1550\,\mathrm {nm}$) for PVBs ($w=1.72\,\mu \mathrm {m}$, mean $0.985$) vs.\ $\mathrm {LG}_{0,l}$ ($w_0=4.50, 3.22\,\mu \mathrm {m}$), achieving $+6.90\,\mathrm {dB}$ gain at $l=4$; inset shows $l=4$ OOK BER with the $0.41\,\mathrm {dB}$ AWGN ZF penalty at $\Delta R = 2.0w$. (b) Intensity MSE (solid, $\pm 1\,\mathrm {SEM}$) and field MSE (dashed/dash-dotted) over 40 Kolmogorov phase screens ($D=3.0\,\mathrm {mm}, z=0.5\,\mathrm {m}$) for raw, $P_{\mathrm {RKHS}}$, and Tikhonov ($\alpha _{\mathrm {reg}}=0.0183$) filtering. (c) Passive $M=5$ Gouy IC-POVM radial qudit tomography ($d=4, l=1, w/w_0=0.25$, rank $16/16$ vs.\ $7/16$ at $M=1$): $R\rho R$ MLE MSE (circles, 30 trials) tracks CRB $41.80/N_{\mathrm {phot}}$ alongside 5-MUB tomography ($18.75/N_{\mathrm {phot}}$). (d) SPDC Bell--CHSH $S$ vs.\ circular-iris radius $R_{\mathrm {iris}}/R_0$ for $(l=1,4)$ ($w=0.1 R_0$, LG $w_0=\sqrt {2}R_0$); inset shows $t_{1..4}(R_0)$ ($0.4999\text {--}0.4984$ PVB vs.\ $0.2642\text {--}0.0037$ LG)}{figure.3}{}}
